    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/76646b6bea75bd4d147cb80bc715bc96.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragedy that shattered his life, the protagonist isolates himself completely. Radio stalking becomes his only way to silence the pain. But the deeper he dives, the further he drifts from reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/118df5e20bc4953736a4016dcf4863b1.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune into signals, record them, and publish your findings. Likes, views, and money become your new currency. But what are you sacrificing in return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/d85771e0dea92aae35a23368664cda37.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about monsters. It\u2019s a story about how easily you can become trapped in your own thoughts and lose yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/b19ddc65de63fb6736ac342c02071ce0.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions lead to one of two endings. Can you stop before there\u2019s no turning back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/76646b6bea75bd4d147cb80bc715bc96.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a tragedy that shattered his life, the protagonist isolates himself completely. Radio stalking becomes his only way to silence the pain. But the deeper he dives, the further he drifts from reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/118df5e20bc4953736a4016dcf4863b1.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune into signals, record them, and publish your findings. Likes, views, and money become your new currency. But what are you sacrificing in return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/d85771e0dea92aae35a23368664cda37.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about monsters. It\u2019s a story about how easily you can become trapped in your own thoughts and lose yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448810/extras/b19ddc65de63fb6736ac342c02071ce0.avif?t=1747681361\" width=584 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions lead to one of two endings. Can you stop before there\u2019s no turning back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
