        "notes": "RADIO STALKER tackles mature themes and emotional moments that may not be suitable for every audience. The main character's inner struggles will put a large emphasis on the gameplay with central themes such as:\r\n\r\n- Severe depression, isolation, and decay of mental health.\r\n- Visually represented drug treatment, as the use of anti-depression medication is shown for the main protagonist in order to cope with his illness.\r\n- Self-violence and suicide.\r\n- Very disturbing with strong psychological horror elements. - Tension and discomfort rise during gameplay.\r\n\r\nThe above themes are deeply connected with the storyline and are of a grave nature; therefore, they shall have an after-effect on the player reconsidering it during gameplay. Potential players need to be made aware of what they will be dealing with."
